Package: VetmeduniAppTemplate
Type: Package
Title: Shared Presentation Components for Shiny Analysis Applications
Version: 0.2.5
Author: Nicola Palmieri
Maintainer: VetmeduniAppTemplate maintainers <maintainer@example.invalid>
Contact: Nicola Palmieri
URL: https://github.com/nicola-palmieri/VetmeduniAppTemplate
BugReports: https://github.com/nicola-palmieri/VetmeduniAppTemplate/issues
Description: Configurable branding, home pages, compact sidebar controls,
    accessible contextual help, plot styling, palettes, intrinsic figure sizing
    and PNG exports for Shiny applications. Application data and statistical
    analyses remain in each consuming application.
